        "original_id": "c96e8d78-efdd-5771-b389-dc2c29c73bfb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Murray Head, Andrew Lloyd Webber, Tim Rice\n- Works: \"Superstar\", Jesus Christ Superstar, \"One Night in Bangkok\", Chess, Say It Ain't So, Find the Crowd\n- Places: France\n\nFacts:\n- Murray Head was born on 5 March 1946 and is an English actor and singer.\n- \"Superstar\" is the title song from the 1970 rock opera Jesus Christ Superstar.\n- Jesus Christ Superstar was written by Andrew Lloyd Webber and Tim Rice.\n- Murray Head is widely recognized for the song \"Superstar\" from Jesus Christ Superstar.\n- Murray Head released the album Say It Ain't So in 1975.\n- Murray Head is widely recognized for the 1984 single \"One Night in Bangkok\" from the musical Chess.\n- \"One Night in Bangkok\" topped the charts in various countries.\n- Find the Crowd is a live album by Murray Head.\n- Find the Crowd was recorded at three concerts in France.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
